# Local API key setup (only needed when running the notebooks OUTSIDE Google Colab).
#
# 1. Copy this file and rename the copy to:  .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder below with your own Gemini API key
#    (create one for free at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)
# 3. Save — the notebooks pick it up automatically via python-dotenv.
#
# The .env file is gitignored, so your real key will never be committed.
#
# Colab users: skip this file entirely. Instead, add a secret named
# GOOGLE_API_KEY in Colab's Secrets panel (🔑 icon in the left sidebar)
# and toggle "Notebook access" on.

GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
